  "description": "The official C# implementation of ISON (Interchange Simple Object Notation), from the authors of the ISON format — a token-efficient data format for AI/LLM workflows.\n\nPart of the original ISON family, released and versioned together with ison-py (PyPI), ison-parser and ison-ts (npm), ison-rs (crates.io), ison-go, and ison-cpp.\n\nFull ISON and ISONL support: parsing, serialization, type inference, references, field type annotations, streaming, and JSON interop.\n\nIncludes ISONCS (ISON Canonical Serialization) for byte-identical output across every implementation in the family — 'id' hoisted first, remaining fields sorted by UTF-8 byte order — verified on every release against a shared cross-language parity corpus generated from the reference implementation.\n\nStay on this package to stay current: specification changes, fixes, edge-case hardening, hotfixes, and security patches ship here as they land in the spec — so you pick them up with a routine package update instead of tracking them yourself.",
